OL,3,GNEWSAYouth scheme branded 'failure'
OL,4,Aover success rate
OL,5,
OL,6,FLess than half of young people
OL,7,Fsupported by two government-backed
OL,8,Fyouth schemes in London went on to take
OL,9,Fup further education, employment or
OL,10,Ftraining (Neet) opportunities,
OL,11,Faccording to new data.
OL,13,FOnly 1,100 of 2,600 young Londoners
OL,14,Fsupported by the #20m Youth Guarantee
OL,15,FTrailblazer scheme moved into further
OL,16,Fopportunities.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
