OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAYouth scheme branded 'failure'
OL,4,Aover success rate
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer youth worker and Conservative
OL,7,Fpeer Shaun Bailey said the scheme was a
OL,8,F"failure" and called for more support
OL,9,Ffor employers but Skills Minister
OL,10,FJacqui Smith said it was helping young
OL,11,Fpeople furthest from the labour market
OL,12,Fand that it was still "early days".
OL,14,FA major government report is expected
OL,15,Fto set out recommendations for tackling
OL,16,Fthe problem next week.
